[09:18.48]preferential [ˌprefəˈrenʃl]a. 优先的；特惠的，优惠的
[09:23.16]austerity [ɒˈsterəti]n. (经济的)紧缩；简朴，朴素 例 Virtually all plans are to step up the pace of austerity.
[09:33.12]whilst [waɪlst]conj. 时时，同时 例 I watched a world-class performance whilst I was in England.
