[11:39.72]warranty [ˈwɒrənti]n. (商品、产品的)担保书，保单；保 证，担保；担保条款 搭 under warranty 在保修期内
[11:47.40]emotional [ɪˈməʊʃənl]a. 情绪的；易激动的；感动人的 例 Emotional control is needed for everyone, especially someone who's in the service industry. 搭 emotional intelligence 情商 / emotional reaction 情绪反应
